Break Bumper!

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:47.947
ALL: The Break Bumper!

00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:50.283
The recipe is stolen,
no one believes,

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:53.786
from the wallet
of Teddy Roosevelt's valet.

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:55.655
(CHUCKLING)

00:00:56.188 --> 00:00:57.156
Cheers, everyone.

00:00:57.256 --> 00:00:58.792
-Cheers. Welcome.
-ALL: Cheers.

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:05.131
Yeah, I'm actually getting
my second PhD right now

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:07.467
-in Africana studies from Brown.
-Oh?

00:01:07.934 --> 00:01:09.969
Wow, so, you'll be
a double doctor?

00:01:10.102 --> 00:01:12.672
