on Wikipedia.
-(TOM SNICKERS)

00:01:22.882 --> 00:01:24.684
But seriously, though.
Well done.

00:01:24.784 --> 00:01:26.786
-That's quite an achievement.
-Thank you.

00:01:26.986 --> 00:01:29.955
-Connor Roy! Maxim Pierce.
-Mm-hmm. Hi.

00:01:30.222 --> 00:01:31.791
