00:02:26.712 --> 00:02:28.080
Uh, you know, I'm well.

00:02:28.614 --> 00:02:31.851
I'm very well. I'm...
working real hard, you know.

00:02:32.284 --> 00:02:33.819
-Yeah?
-ROMAN: Yeah. No.

00:02:34.253 --> 00:02:36.422
Not at all. Really. Maybe.
